The "OC Worldview Content" means all original creative material in this
repository relating to the author's original characters (OCs) and their
fictional universe, including but not limited to:

  - Names, designs, appearances, personalities, biographies, and any
    other depictions of the original characters;
  - Settings, locations, factions, organizations, species, religions,
    magic/physics systems, technologies, languages, and history of the
    fictional universe;
  - Plotlines, narratives, dialogue, lore entries, timelines, and any
    other written worldbuilding;
  - Artwork, illustrations, reference sheets, 3D models, textures, and
    any other visual depictions of the above;
  - Any derivative or adapted version of the above.

“OC 世界观内容”指本仓库中与作者原创角色（OC）及其虚构世界相关的一切原创内容，
包括但不限于：

  - 原创角色的姓名、设定、外观、性格、背景、形象及一切其他表现形式；
  - 该虚构世界的背景、地点、阵营、组织、种族、宗教、物理体系、科技、
    语言与历史；
  - 剧情、叙事、对白、设定文档、年表及一切其他世界观文字；
  - 上述内容的插画、立绘、设定图、3D、贴图、音乐及一切其他视听表现；
  - 上述内容的任何衍生或改编版本。

